<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>ISFP’s Sunset (Soft Light)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">樊宇镈(Coulson Fan)</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">ISFP's Sunset</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3zNl3vd5Rqp9Satkzic1Cm</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:30.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500">ISFP's Sunset (Soft Light)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.010" end="00:01.510">作词: 樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.020" end="00:01.520">作曲: 樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.030" end="00:01.530">编曲: 樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.040" end="00:01.540">统筹：王若彤</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.050" end="00:01.550">推广：王昊/付佳慧</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.060" end="00:01.560">监制：王若彤</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.070" end="00:01.570">出品人：李林鸿@大音工作室</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.260" end="00:01.760">You forgot your scarf,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.260" end="00:03.080">那天你围巾落在了椅背上，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.080" end="00:04.580">So I folded it the way you like,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.080" end="00:08.600">我照你平时的方式折好，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.600" end="00:10.100">Left it by your door,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.600" end="00:10.120">放在你家门口，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.120" end="00:11.620">Didn’t text，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.120" end="00:11.850">没发消息也没打扰你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.850" end="00:13.350">Just walked away,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.850" end="00:14.570">我只是觉得你回来的时候应该刚好能看见，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.570" end="00:16.070">You said you loved sunsets,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.570" end="00:17.960">你说你喜欢傍晚的落日，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.960" end="00:19.460">So I changed my route,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.960" end="00:22.530">我换了一条回家的路，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.530" end="00:24.030">Just to walk with you once,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.530" end="00:24.680">从你可能出现的那条巷子走，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.680" end="00:26.180">But stayed a step behind,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.680" end="00:29.980">看到你了但我走得比你慢一点，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.980" end="00:31.480">I never told you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.980" end="00:32.830">我从没说过我在，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.830" end="00:34.330">But I was always there,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.830" end="00:36.640">但其实我一直都在，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.640" end="00:38.140">In the quiet,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.640" end="00:38.300">在你以为没人陪的时候，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.300" end="00:39.800">In the small things,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.300" end="00:40.300">在那些你没有注意的小细节里，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.300" end="00:41.800">You never asked about,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.300" end="00:43.930">你好像从不问我的心思，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.930" end="00:45.430">I never needed words,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.930" end="00:45.560">但我不需要你说什么，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.560" end="00:47.060">I just hoped you'd notice,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.560" end="00:47.840">只希望你能感觉到，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.840" end="00:49.340">The tea I made each night,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.840" end="00:49.680">那些细微的照顾，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.680" end="00:51.180">The silence I left open,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.680" end="00:51.480">那些静静的守护，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.480" end="00:52.980">The way I stayed behind,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.480" end="00:53.080">在你难过的时候，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.080" end="00:54.580">When things got too broken,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.080" end="00:55.010">我陪在你身旁，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.010" end="00:56.510">I’m not loud, not bright，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.010" end="00:57.550">想去说些什么但又怕打扰到你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.550" end="00:59.050">But I was always hoping,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.550" end="00:59.110">也许默默的陪伴就是最好，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.110" end="01:00.610">I never raised my voice,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.110" end="01:00.610">在我们的争吵里我从来没提高声音，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.340" end="01:01.840">But I was always listening,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.340" end="01:01.880">我压抑着情绪尽可能去理解你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.880" end="01:03.380">The shoes I cleaned for you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.880" end="01:03.380">为你做的每一件小事，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.370" end="01:04.870">The door I left half-open,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.370" end="01:05.400">体贴你的每一个瞬间，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.400" end="01:06.900">I held the pain so still,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.400" end="01:07.130">你说你怕束缚，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.130" end="01:08.630">So you could breathe so freely,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.130" end="01:09.850">所以我连关门都留一条缝，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.850" end="01:11.350">I’m not loud, not brave，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.850" end="01:11.940">一直把自己藏得很轻，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.940" end="01:13.440">But I was always steady,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.940" end="01:13.440">因为我真的喜欢你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.360" end="01:14.860">You cried once at the train stop,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.360" end="01:16.930">那次你在地铁站哭了说你好累，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.930" end="01:18.430">I didn’t ask why，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.930" end="01:18.900">I我知道了我们的结果但没问你为什么，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.900" end="01:20.400">Just stood beside you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.900" end="01:20.640">只是递了张纸巾，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.640" end="01:22.140">Offered a napkin,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.640" end="01:22.190">然后一路没开口，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.190" end="01:23.690">Then changed the song when we got home,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.190" end="01:29.800">回到家，我把你最讨厌的那首歌换掉了，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.800" end="01:31.300">You said you hate goodbyes,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.800" end="01:31.460">你说你不喜欢道别，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.460" end="01:32.960">So I never made one,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.460" end="01:33.680">所以我最后也没说再见，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.680" end="01:35.180">Just let you drift,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.680" end="01:36.760">只是慢慢走开，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.760" end="01:38.260">Even if it meant,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.760" end="01:38.970">怕你觉得有压力，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.970" end="01:40.470">You’d forget where I was，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.970" end="01:45.170">也怕你真的不会回头，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.170" end="01:46.670">It’s okay if you missed it，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.170" end="01:48.100">可能你从来没发现，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.100" end="01:49.600">I wasn’t trying to be known，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.100" end="01:51.720">我为你做的事都很小，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.720" end="01:53.220">Just wanted to love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.720" end="01:53.930">小到不被察觉 但我不是想被看见，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.930" end="01:55.430">Without asking for return,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.930" end="01:58.990">只是想你轻松一点就好，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.990" end="02:00.490">I never needed words,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.990" end="02:01.030">我不需要你说什么，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.030" end="02:02.530">I just hoped you'd notice,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.030" end="02:03.270">只希望你能感觉到，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.270" end="02:04.770">The tea I made each night,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.270" end="02:04.770">那些细微的照顾，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.690" end="02:06.190">The silence I left open,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.690" end="02:06.510">那些静静的守护，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.510" end="02:08.010">The way I stayed behind,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.510" end="02:08.040">在你难过的时候，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.040" end="02:09.540">When things got too broken,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.040" end="02:10.020">我陪在你身旁，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.020" end="02:11.520">I’m not loud, not bright，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.020" end="02:12.600">想去说些什么但又怕打扰到你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.600" end="02:14.100">But I was always hoping,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.600" end="02:14.190">也许默默的陪伴就是最好，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.190" end="02:15.690">I never raised my voice,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.190" end="02:15.690">在我们的争吵里我从来没提高声音，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.430" end="02:16.930">But I was always listening,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.430" end="02:17.210">我压抑着情绪尽可能去理解你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.210" end="02:18.710">The shoes I cleaned for you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.210" end="02:18.760">为你做的每一件小事，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.760" end="02:20.260">The door I left half-open,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.760" end="02:20.850">体贴你的每一个瞬间，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.850" end="02:22.350">I held the pain so still,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.850" end="02:22.410">你说你怕束缚，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.410" end="02:23.910">So you could breathe so freely,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.410" end="02:24.560">所以我连关门都留一条缝，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.560" end="02:26.060">I’m not loud, not brave，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.560" end="02:26.540">一直把自己藏得很轻，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.540" end="02:28.040">But I was always steady,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.540" end="02:28.390">因为我真的喜欢你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.390" end="02:29.890">Some of us love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.390" end="02:30.840">有些人爱得像风，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.840" end="02:32.340">Like leaves in a window,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.840" end="02:34.140">轻轻地吹过你窗前，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.140" end="02:35.640">Quiet,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.140" end="02:35.640">不吵不闹，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.170" end="02:36.670">Brief,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.170" end="02:36.670">但一直在找角度，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.290" end="02:37.790">But always,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.290" end="02:37.790">落在你刚好需要的那个地方，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.010" end="02:38.510">Trying to catch your light,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.010" end="02:42.210">我从没开口让你留下，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.210" end="02:43.710">I never asked you to stay,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.210" end="02:43.930">我一直在为你让路，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.930" end="02:45.430">But I always made it easy,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.930" end="02:45.730">你总是走得很快，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.730" end="02:47.230">I showed up in small ways,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.730" end="02:47.510">我就悄悄换路，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.510" end="02:49.010">When you thought no one could see me,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.510" end="02:49.420">在你习惯的时间经过你身边，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.420" end="02:50.920">I held back every time,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.420" end="02:51.100">我把我的伤藏起来，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.100" end="02:52.600">So you'd never feel too heavy,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.100" end="02:53.010">不想让你感到沉重，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.010" end="02:54.510">I gave without a name,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.010" end="02:54.870">想用生活里的点滴，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.870" end="02:56.370">And loved you almost quietly,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.870" end="02:56.780">也许我应该多点表达多去争一些什么，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.780" end="02:58.280">I never asked you to stay,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.780" end="02:58.300">但这不是我，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.300" end="02:59.800">But I always made it easy,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.300" end="03:00.090">我不想给你压力，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.090" end="03:01.590">I showed up in small ways,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.090" end="03:01.880">也许多年后的某个黄昏，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.880" end="03:03.380">When you thought no one could see me,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.880" end="03:03.690">你会想起我，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.690" end="03:05.190">I held back every time,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.690" end="03:05.400">你会发现那些的无微不至的细节里，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.400" end="03:06.900">So you'd never feel too heavy,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.400" end="03:07.260">那些你习以为常的事情，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.260" end="03:08.760">I gave without a name,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.260" end="03:09.070">那些，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.070" end="03:10.570">And loved you almost,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.070" end="03:13.110">其实藏着我对你，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.110" end="03:14.610">quietly,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.110" end="03:17.110">最深的爱意。</p></div></body></tt>